3. Use network analysis to identify the most important touchpoints in the customer journey. This can help businesses focus their efforts on improving the most impactful touchpoints.
4. Use visualization techniques such as heatmaps, Sankey diagrams, and chord diagrams to present complex data in a more intuitive and understandable way.
