\textbf{Conclusion:} \\
\end{align*}
In conclusion, the concept of justice plays a crucial role in evaluating the morality of the protagonist's actions in the story. The act of theft violates the principles of distributive and procedural justice, which require that individuals should be treated fairly and equitably in the distribution of resources and benefits and in all procedures and decisions. The presence of CCTV footage and police investigation can be seen as a way of ensuring justice and upholding the principles of fairness and impartiality.

